      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اطمعهُ</span></b>  <i>He made him to covet,</i> &amp;c.; (S, * O, *
Msb, * K, TA;) and so ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طمّعهُ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَطْمِيعٌ</span>:
(TA:) the verb is followed by <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِى</span> [and app. by
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِ</span> also] before the object. (S.)

